---
import ResidenceLayout from "../../../layouts/ResidenceLayout.astro";
import { frederick } from "../../../data/residences/frederick";
---

<ResidenceLayout
  residence={frederick}
  title="Nearby parks & essentials · Frederick Cottage | Mt Cottages"
  description="Nearby parks, recreation, groceries, healthcare, and daily essentials around Frederick Cottage in Marietta — planning prompts with confirmation steps."
  eyebrow="Frederick Cottage · Nearby"
  heading="Marietta days, planned well."
  lede="River paths, parks, groceries, care, and the routes that shape a working week — framed as planning prompts until distances are verified."
>
  <section class="section section--paper">
    <div class="site-width">
      <div class="section-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">Parks & recreation</p><h2>Time outside the assignment.</h2></div><p>Marietta's riverfront, historic streets, and regional parks give a longer stay somewhere to go after hours. Confirm routes and access for the season of the stay.</p></div>
      <ol class="step-grid">
        <li class="reveal"><strong>Riverfront</strong><p>Ohio and Muskingum river paths for walks, runs, and evening air. Ask about the closest access and parking.</p></li>
        <li class="reveal"><strong>Parks</strong><p>Town parks and playgrounds for families; regional trails for longer weekends. Confirm what is open in-season.</p></li>
        <li class="reveal"><strong>Downtown</strong><p>Historic center with food, coffee, and errands in one trip. Good for the weekly rhythm.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="site-width">
      <div class="section-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">Everyday essentials</p><h2>Groceries, care, and routes.</h2></div><p>Map these before arrival: the weekly shop, the commute or facility, pharmacy, and the after-hours plan.</p></div>
      <div class="prose">
         <article class="prose-section reveal"><h2>Groceries & errands</h2><div class="stack"><p>The cottage sits just off I-77 near the Ohio River, with Kroger, Walmart, and a shopping plaza close by. Plan a weekly shop around the full kitchen, plus pharmacy and household goods.</p></div></article>
        <article class="prose-section reveal"><h2>Healthcare & work routes</h2><div class="stack"><p>Marietta suits guests balancing a local assignment with everyday services. Share facility, shift pattern, and commute tolerance in the inquiry for a practical fit check.</p><div class="cluster"><a class="button button--ghost" href="/health-professionals.html">Healthcare stays</a><a class="text-link" href="/work-relocation.html">Work stays</a></div></div></article>
        <article class="prose-section reveal"><h2>Schools & family</h2><div class="stack"><p>Traveling with children changes the map. Share school, childcare, and activity needs early — see Family stays for the household-first approach.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ResidenceLayout>
